Data licenses for open-business-finder

This repository ships code (MIT, see LICENSE) and one small data file:
src/open_business_finder/data/categories.csv. It lists the category names of the
Overture Maps places theme with their worldwide record counts for one release.

Overture Maps Foundation data, which the tool queries at run time, is licensed per theme:

- Places: Community Data License Agreement - Permissive, Version 2.0 (CDLA-Permissive-2.0).
  https://cdla.dev/permissive-2-0/
- Divisions (administrative boundaries): Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0, because the
  theme includes data derived from OpenStreetMap.
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Required attribution when you publish results:

  Places data: Overture Maps Foundation (CDLA-Permissive-2.0).
  Boundaries: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, Overture Maps Foundation (ODbL 1.0).

See https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/ for the current wording.
The licenses of data you obtain with this tool are those of Overture and its sources,
not the MIT license of this code.
